        "editor": "<p style=\"margin:0;max-width:560px;\">Let’s start with our favourite first!… With the recent updates to the Sugerbag MTB park, brought with it a brand-new Pump Track so for the first time ever Rocky Trail held the Pump Track Challenge. Music blasting, spectators under the Redbull tent and excitement levels are high as the best riders from all over QLD push each other around a never before ridden pump track.</p>",
